WEBVTT

00:43:27.114 --> 00:43:30.212
Or when Alan Turing
invented the Turing machine,

00:43:30.236 --> 00:43:31.863
everything can be built from that.

00:43:31.887 --> 00:43:33.466
I think it's too theoretical.

00:43:33.877 --> 00:43:40.141
Until we see the abilities I talked about
beginning to be implemented,

00:43:40.165 --> 00:43:42.514
and real intelligence being shown,

00:43:42.538 --> 00:43:46.379
I think we're just way too far
from where the humans are.

00:43:46.403 --> 00:43:48.870
And I think I can say with confidence,

00:43:48.894 --> 00:43:52.283
in 20 years, we will not see
general intelligence.

00:43:52.307 --> 00:43:55.009
CA: So talk about
what you are concerned about.

00:43:55.033 --> 00:43:59.406
KFL: I think a big concern I have
is about job displacement,

00:43:59.430 --> 00:44:03.621
because AI is able to do
routine tasks better than people